 the carried over **1**: \\(14 + 1 = 15\\)  .\n   Write down **5** and carry over **1** to the hundreds place.\n\n3. **Hundreds place:**  .\n   \\(9 + 9 = 18\\)  .\n   Add the carried over **1**: \\(18 + 1 = 19\\)  .\n   Write down **9** and carry over **1** to the thousands place.\n\n4. **Thousands place:**  .\n   \\(7 + 7 = 14\\)  .\n   Add the carried over **1**: \\(14 + 1 = 15\\)  .\n   Write down **5** and carry over **1** to the ten-thousands place.\n\n5. **Ten-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(4 + 6 = 10\\)  .\n   Add the carried over **1**: \\(10 + 1 = 11\\)  .\n   Write down **1** and carry over **1** to the hundred-thousands place.\n\n6. **Hundred-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(1 + 9 = 10\\)  .\n   Add the carried over **1**: \\(10 + 1 = 11\\)  .\n   Write down **1** and carry over **1** to the millions place.\n\n7. **Millions place:**  .\n   There's only the carried over **1**, so write it down.\n\nPutting it all together:.\n\n```.\n    1 4 7 9 7 4.\n  + 9 6 7 9 7 7.\n  ================.\n  1 1 1 5 9 5 1.\n```.\n\n# Answer:.Therefore, the answer is"]]
